{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Sometimes our bodies do not feel well. We might have a cough or a fever.","words":[[0,0.7],[0.77,0.95],[1.02,1.39],[1.44,1.54],[1.63,1.79],[1.87,2.15],[2.22,2.69],[3.08,3.23],[3.29,3.53],[3.58,3.76],[3.79,3.83],[3.91,4.31],[4.4,4.56],[4.63,4.66],[4.79,5.67]]},{"text":"When we are sick, doctors and nurses help us get better.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.4],[0.45,0.61],[0.69,1.07],[1.11,1.61],[1.67,1.79],[1.86,2.33],[2.42,2.65],[2.72,2.83],[2.9,3.1],[3.18,3.99]]},{"text":"Doctors learn about the body and how to treat illnesses.","words":[[0,0.51],[0.58,0.86],[0.92,1.2],[1.24,1.31],[1.37,1.67],[1.73,1.82],[1.9,2.08],[2.16,2.23],[2.31,2.59],[2.66,3.81]]},{"text":"Medicine is something that can help the body heal.","words":[[0,0.57],[0.61,0.71],[0.78,1.21],[1.28,1.44],[1.52,1.72],[1.86,2.16],[2.23,2.3],[2.37,2.66],[2.74,3.44]]},{"text":"Some medicines fight tiny germs that make us sick.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.35,0.95],[1.04,1.35],[1.39,1.73],[1.8,2.18],[2.23,2.39],[2.47,2.73],[2.79,2.89],[2.97,3.71]]},{"text":"Our bodies are strong and can heal with rest, water, and care.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.34,0.76],[0.81,0.97],[1.03,1.52],[1.61,1.8],[1.87,2.04],[2.14,2.43],[2.51,2.72],[2.8,3.2],[3.27,3.75],[3.77,3.91],[4.02,4.83]]},{"text":"Vaccines help teach our bodies how to fight certain germs.","words":[[0,0.59],[0.66,0.92],[1,1.26],[1.32,1.47],[1.54,1.93],[1.99,2.14],[2.21,2.25],[2.36,2.67],[2.73,3.15],[3.22,4.09]]},{"text":"Eating healthy food helps keep our bodies strong.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.48,0.82],[0.91,1.21],[1.28,1.6],[1.68,1.95],[2.02,2.18],[2.26,2.63],[2.68,3.62]]},{"text":"Washing hands helps stop germs from spreading.","words":[[0,0.5],[0.59,0.99],[1.08,1.41],[1.43,1.74],[1.83,2.24],[2.3,2.51],[2.58,3.48]]},{"text":"Medicine, care, and healthy habits help us feel better and stay strong.","words":[[0,0.67],[0.73,1.22],[1.24,1.41],[1.5,1.9],[1.99,2.48],[2.94,3.22],[3.3,3.44],[3.53,3.8],[3.88,4.23],[4.3,4.43],[4.52,4.83],[4.9,5.85]]}]}